Hi Sam,

I was going to let you know about that when I ran into you again out in the=
 field but haven't had a chance.  It would be completely fine to head out o=
n Monday the 31st as that is usually what I try to coordinate with my depar=
ting and incoming Volunteers.  Thank you for double checking though as I di=
dn't note it on the schedules that I printed out.

Leaving and arriving on the final day of the month is actually what most pa=
rks are trying to coordinate with each other so that everyone can have a sm=
ooth transition into the new month and able to jump right into the orientat=
ions on the 1st.

[cid:image001.jpg@01DB94E6.E3B35010]Logan Bliss | Volunteer Services Lead/R=
anger 1
